  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Removing Barriers, Improving Access to Women&#x2019;s and Girls&#x2019; SRHR . Uganda.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Uganda project targets 4000 women in remote rural areas who will receive regular information, counselling and capacity-building relating to SRHR. In addition, 800 girls will receive SRHR information quarterly, and men attending activities. The project will train nurses/midwives as coordinators, 100 senior mentors and 100 trainee mentors to conduct the information-sharing and capacity-building activities for the 4,000 women at village level.</narrative>
  </description>
